###Ver Perfil (Rota Protegida)
GET http://localhost:3000/usuario/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{meuToken}}

###Atualizar Nome
PUT http://localhost:3000/usuario/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{meuToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Ana Silva Atualizada"
}

### Desativar a própria conta (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/usuario/conta
Authorization: Bearer {{meuToken}}